1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Medical store chalate hain?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Ye chhoti si cheez aapki shop ki branding badha sakti hai.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Pehle hum normal plain packet mein medicine dete the.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Customer ko shop ka naam ya number yaad nahi rehta tha.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Customized printed medicine pouch use karne ke baad farq dikhta hai.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Is par shop ka naam, address, mobile number aur design print hota hai.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Patient ghar par packet dekhta hai, to aapki details saamne hoti hain.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Repeat order aur customer recall easy ho jaate hain.

9
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Apni branding ke liye customized medicine pouch zaroor use kijiye.
